-- 1. Footing — the anchor is set. Solo double bass, room, a foot tap.
-- Eval 00-setup.tidal first.
-- ~32 cycles (~84 s at 92 BPM).

setbpm 92

d6 bassFoot

-- brushes arrive like a foot keeping time, not a drum kit
xfadeIn 2 16 brushFoot

-- a low piano pedal appears under the bass
xfadeIn 4 24 pianoPedal

-- first hint of the room: a single breath
-- xfadeIn 10 16 air

-- the bass starts to walk
-- xfadeIn 6 16 bassWalk
